{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-06-06 09:51:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL NAMED ONE OF THE “MOST TRUSTWORTHY COMPANIES IN AMERICA” BY NEWSWEEK FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL (NYSE: AMP) HAS BEEN NAMED TO NEWSWEEK'S LIST OF “MOST TRUSTWORTHY COMPANIES IN AMERICA” FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE LIST, ALSO IN ITS SECOND YEAR, RECOGNIZES 700 COMPANIES IN 23 INDUSTRIES. “WE'RE HONORED BY THE TRUST OUR MORE THAN TWO MILLION CLIENTS PUT IN AMERIPRISE, AND WE'RE COMMITTED TO PUTTING THEIR NEEDS FIRST,” SAID JIM CRACCHIOLO, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AT AMERIPRISE. “WE HAVE INVESTED SIGNIFICANTLY IN CREATING."}